    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "•\tOur dataset contains both R (April23_24.RData and NOV1_23.mat) and Matlab data that we have created for the machine learning model and plots we included in the article\r\n•\tAll codes for model training and testing are shared with names “e.g., CodesForNoGeoModel”. All R codes for the Figures in the article is shared as “NewFig1-4”\r\n•\tCodes for SI figures are also shared, such as “scatter_core_outer” and “SI_2”, etc\r\n•\tR libraries “caret”, “xgboost”, “gridExtra”, “cowplot” need to be installed and loaded before running the codes listed",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
